### Create connect link — outside allowlist (expects 400 invalid_platform)  [protected]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/integrations/zernio/connect-links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "platform": "tiktok"
}

### Create connect link — Bluesky is intentionally excluded (expects 400)  [protected]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/integrations/zernio/connect-links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "platform": "bluesky"
}

### Create connect link — missing platform (expects 400)  [protected]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/integrations/zernio/connect-links
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Create connect link — empty platform (expects 400)  [protected]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/integrations/zernio/connect-links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "platform": ""
}

# Rate-limit smoke test: the bucket is 30/min per Ogen instance. Run this
# block 31 times in quick succession to see the 31st return 429 with a
# Retry-After header.
### Rate-limit probe (run 31x; the 31st expects 429 rate_limited)  [protected]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/integrations/zernio/connect-links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "platform": "linkedin"
}

### List local social-account mirror + last sync metadata  [protected]
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/integrations/zernio/accounts
Accept: application/json

### Trigger an immediate sync tick  [protected]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/integrations/zernio/sync
Accept: application/json

### Repair profile — re-runs the bootstrap (idempotent)  [protected]
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/integrations/zernio/profile/repair
Accept: application/json
